# maluos-apps: the host tools every Business OS application's build needs, so
# the kernel's installer (bin/app_install.php) can clone, build and register
# an application at first boot (docs/components.md, the maluos-apps proposal).
# In the server image beside maluos-business-os. The applications themselves
# are cloned from github.com/maludb/maludb-os-<key> at first boot (phase 1);
# packaged as maludb-os-<key> later (phase 3).
maluos-business-os
composer
python3-venv
python3-pip
poppler-utils
unzip
git
